{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_069_title", "source_sha256": "b7d2394ffa3bc550a375d08e58cc933a7e9ede6786bdd7224db8dc0c1f3213d4", "ja": "憧れを乗せて", "zh": "满载憧憬", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_069_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5054f60adbf9ba8028cb37cbc448afb708453d57458f13728f5a83169d8a6ffe", "ja": "定期公演で新曲を歌うことになった星梨花。\r\nプロデューサーにどんな曲がいいかと尋ねら\r\nれ悩んでしまうが、劇場の仲間やプロデュー\r\nサーと話すうちに答えにたどりつく。それは\r\nその時感じている気持ちそのものだった。", "zh": "星梨花决定在定期公演上演唱新曲。\n面对制作人关于想要什么样歌曲的询问，\n她陷入了烦恼之中，但在和剧场的同伴以及制作人\n交流的过程中找到了答案。那就是\n将自己彼时所感受到的心意原原本本表达出来的歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_069_1000_p", "source_sha256": "60cb0854009e68796194e0ab39d550da51781b06b664e06eb4179e76984f8a4a", "ja": "（星梨花の新曲公演が終わった。\n客席に鳴り響く拍手は、収まる様子を見せない）", "zh": "（星梨花的新歌公演结束了。观众席响起的掌声，丝毫没有停下来的迹象）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_069_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "a9954ed2d415d5a3fd9e6bdcb0ed5e93b0ea3606f1af94391ec3c42436e4fe03", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……{$P$}さん！\n今日のステージ、どうでしたか？", "zh": "哈啊，哈啊……{$P$}先生！今天的舞台，您觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_069_1002_p", "source_sha256": "82f4ab0cf4259f1e4e2c8b2f56e219c87cec114ab487644d7d0bf7651b01f47d", "ja": "お疲れさま、星梨花！　とってもよかったよ。\n客席はまだ、ファンの笑顔でいっぱいだしな！", "zh": "辛苦了，星梨花！表现得特别好。\n观众席上现在还满是粉丝们的笑脸呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_069_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "87e13a4c63403e230ec9260ebac746d33179c7f30cc06ef053254134d289c340", "ja": "本当ですか？　じゃあ、ちゃんと歌えたんですね。\nえへへ、よかったです♪", "zh": "真的吗？那我就是好好唱完了吧。\n嘿嘿，太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_069_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "653201711655a38f62993288ca048f67ce71d91f656c53964c7354ce07de7de6", "ja": "わたし、これからもファンのみなさんに、毎日\n楽しかったり、うれしい気持ちになってほしいです。", "zh": "我希望今后也能让各位粉丝每天\n都感到开心，充满快乐的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_069_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "3e0a3c2a4ffbee4e450e56d8fc03128ed0977326ac1b8758bfc6452b5a6abb15", "ja": "毎日ドキドキしてほしいです。だからわたしも、\n早くステキなものを見つけて届けようって思います。", "zh": "希望大家每天都能心跳加速。所以我也想赶快找到美好的东西，带给大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_069_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "662266e9238d5a0d4bf3543027ff0089f31929162f3141e7e7acfa0481f8465e", "ja": "だってわたしも……。\n劇場の、アイドルですから！", "zh": "因为我也是……剧场里的偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_069_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c2e212193fe648e3da7637f85ff09386e6fa64504727e3fe85adce9cf69e49f6", "ja": "……うん、そうだな。\n星梨花はこの劇場の、自慢のアイドルだ！", "zh": "……嗯，说得对。\n星梨花是这个剧场引以为傲的偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_069_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "2159f5b7ad12977cc055b0df92c1f493d63d2d95f5c904be1947dadacbae52de", "ja": "せりり～ん！　お疲れさま～！\nすっ…………ごく、可愛かった～！！", "zh": "星梨花～！辛苦啦～！\n真…………的超级可爱～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_069_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "dd9040051c55b644d47cbe1dd10d0853e36b42ecaa9c1a9e24adebdb782a444b", "ja": "ホントホント！　それに楽しかったよ、星梨花♪\nお客さんも、すっ…………ごく、楽しそうだった～！", "zh": "真的真的！而且特别开心哦，星梨花♪\n观众们看起来也玩得超……开心～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_069_1010_005yay", "source_sha256": "592a146bd79ca08fcfbc0c2c41aae00163cd4e089fbd376f6052783933ec3e68", "ja": "えへへっ、かっこよかったよ、星梨花ちゃん！\n後ろから見てて、なんか頼もしいなーって。", "zh": "嘿嘿，真的很帅气哦，星梨花！  \n从后面看着你，感觉特别可靠呢——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_069_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "cdc3ebfe8f91233ab35e709780bc59d87e653c95e76491d8627e03a2fb4b5d83", "ja": "今日の星梨花ちゃんは、美少女アイドルオーラが\nすごかったよねっ。茜ちゃんと同じくらいね！", "zh": "今天的星梨花，美少女偶像的气场\n特别强呢。和小茜差不多哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_069_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "99930514cd6cf942ec4663ea6c1f0e3f1ef2e4ff0d2b1f0423ef772cdc6fd788", "ja": "とんでもありません！\n上手にできたのは、みなさんのおかげです。", "zh": "哪里哪里！\n能顺利完成，多亏了大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_069_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "358f780ee95c3380b82b9cf979001487385fdf656941c8e64dbecfc884c354a5", "ja": "わたしひとりじゃ、どうしたらいいのか……、\n全然わからなかったです。", "zh": "如果只有我一个人，我根本不知道该怎么办……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_069_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "47552da4f757b44457233b3d191521cbc017f0731299369f98c79fda92718249", "ja": "でもみなさんのおかげで、わたし、ちゃんとできたん\nだって思います。本当にありがとうございました！", "zh": "可是多亏了大家，我觉得自己总算好好完成了。真的非常感谢大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_069_1015_005yay", "source_sha256": "4bc9716b30d81e6b5a7412b3d93eef88c15f8a2d31d657753482e8fdcb59bbf8", "ja": "……ううん。私たちは、星梨花ちゃんの後ろから、\nニコニコしてついていっただけだよっ！", "zh": "……不会啦。我们只是笑眯眯地\n跟在星梨花后面的而已啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_069_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "3f0216cc8f557ee26e2b33cb77138f4f4dde12d31b881b12d7dbd5f3d3dff52a", "ja": "でも、先頭の星梨花が一番ニコニコだったかもね♪\nあーあ、もっとついて行きたいな～。", "zh": "不过，走在最前面的星梨花可能才是笑得最开心的那个呢♪\n啊——真想再多跟着她走一会儿啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_069_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "53f7863a88b8b212a7c623dd0c2ba3cd1afa28480567eeac15ce545042974e5b", "ja": "茜ちゃん物知りだから知ってるけど、そう思ってるのは\n絶対、未来ちゃんだけじゃないよ♪　ほーら！", "zh": "小茜很博学，所以知道哦，不过这么想的绝对不只有未来♪你看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_069_1018_audiences", "source_sha256": "f0505579cb5f3b2480ff0a0479309ebf5f27f5f64584b1961ceb624575ad5934", "ja": "アンコール！　アンコール！", "zh": "安可！安可！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_069_1019_029umi", "source_sha256": "a7f037f13c378a5cf4eec5a51d324487dc32bd4f3b1806a8327f46c4fbb60f88", "ja": "わわっ！？　すっごいアンコールの声っ！\nせりりん、ほらほら、みんな待ってるよ！", "zh": "哇哇！？安可声好热烈啊！\n星梨花，快看快看，大家都在等着呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_069_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "07641d013318096e23d4391a2f1d53e7714b39efb4f79a3a6dd267f8252a2fc7", "ja": "わぁ……♪　あの、{$P$}さん！\nもう一回、いいですか？", "zh": "哇……♪那个，{$P$}先生！可以再来一次吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_069_1021_p", "source_sha256": "b1e2718dac57207a4f7958bcf820c019267cd7ca500d1116ffc21af83994398e", "ja": "そうだな、今日は星梨花の公演だ。先頭に立って、\nみんなを好きなところに連れて行っていいんだよ。", "zh": "没错，今天是星梨花的公演。站在最前面，\n带着大家前往想去的地方吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_069_1022_022ser", "source_sha256": "95e2416fbd6e6d3fb498844d087fca8acbd14fdd9e30574d77f92881be4fa67d", "ja": "はいっ、ありがとうございます！　それじゃあ……、\nみなさん！　アンコールに向かって、出発進行です♪", "zh": "好的，谢谢您！那么……大家！向着安可演出，出发咯♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_069_1023_p", "source_sha256": "3822db9f1bbcd39ec91eb31719870e52c68c6fdaadc573713d7268c7a908a06a", "ja": "（アイドルとして、一つの自信を得た星梨花。\n今、仲間たちと一緒にステージへと駆け出していく）", "zh": "（作为偶像，星梨花获得了一份自信。\n此刻，她正和伙伴们一起奔向舞台）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_069_1024_p", "source_sha256": "9857cf2480dcba3d3bae22af5227187327aa4fef969427780e181e89149f2c44", "ja": "（明日へと続くその線路が、途切れないよう……\nこれからも、見守っていかないとな）", "zh": "（为了让那条通往明天的铁路线不会中断……今后也得继续守望下去才行）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
